    {
        "user": "U02TNEJLC84",
        "type": "message",
        "ts": "1738787893.018519",
        "client_msg_id": "8d388b82-6b36-4243-8bdf-d5693b73a977",
        "text": "Why isn't Azure in the <#C04J4U9NK46|de-course-aws> Channel or why isn't there an Azure Channel?? Actually I think Azure itself joined as a student at one point, but then it asked us to agree to 47 different licensing terms, got lost in its own Active Directory, and then spent an hour troubleshooting why it couldn't connect to its own storage account. Eventually, it just... timed out. We assume it's still somewhere in the cloud, trying to figure out which subscription it's under. We miss you Azure!",
        "team": "T01ATQK62F8",
        "user_team": "T01ATQK62F8",
        "source_team": "T01ATQK62F8",
        "user_profile": {
